# Main theme sketch A: "Lamplight". Warm and hopeful, a little bittersweet.
# D major. The G minor chord in bar 4 is borrowed from D minor: the lump-in-the-throat moment.
# The melody climbs from the lamp-lighting arpeggio in bar 1 to one high G in bar 6.
tempo 88
meter 4/4
grid 8
key D major
form A A2

voice lead  inst=pulse duty=0.25 tone=5200 vol=0.42 vib=14 echo=0.22 echotime=0.75 rel=0.18 role=melody pan=-0.08
voice bell  inst=bell vol=0.16 pan=0.25 rev=0.35
voice bass  inst=tri vol=0.72 gate=0.85 role=bass
voice keys  inst=epiano auto=arp:broken rate=2 lo=54 hi=74 vol=0.30 pan=0.2 rev=0.3
voice pad   inst=pad auto=chords lo=50 hi=76 vol=0.20 rev=0.4
voice arp   inst=pulse duty=0.125 auto=arp:up lo=62 hi=81 vol=0.09 pan=0.45 tone=4000 rel=0.05 gate=0.6 echo=0.3 echotime=0.5
voice kit   inst=drums vol=0.32

master room=2.0 wet=0.45 loud=-17

